Feature: Sanitize Export Option\n\n  As a user of the FinTracker app\n  I want to have the option to sanitize my export data\n  So that I can share my financial data without exposing personal information\n\n  Background:\n    Given I am on the settings screen\n    And I have some payment data in the app\n\n  Scenario: Viewing export options with sanitize toggle\n    When I tap on the export option\n    Then I should see export format options\n    And I should see a \"Sanitize Export\" checkbox\n    And the sanitize option should be unchecked by default\n    And I should see explanatory text about removing personal information\n\n  Scenario: Exporting data without sanitization\n    When I tap on the export option\n    And I select \"Amount, Type\" format\n    And I leave the sanitize option unchecked\n    And I confirm the export\n    Then the export should proceed normally\n    And the exported file should contain original data\n    And the filename should not include \"sanitized\" prefix\n\n  Scenario: Exporting data with sanitization enabled\n    When I tap on the export option\n    And I select \"Debit, Credit\" format\n    And I check the \"Sanitize Export\" option\n    And I confirm the export\n    Then I should see a confirmation message mentioning privacy protection\n    And the export should proceed with sanitization\n    And the exported file should have \"sanitized\" in the filename\n    And personal information should be removed from the export\n\n  Scenario: Canceling export from options dialog\n    When I tap on the export option\n    And I tap the cancel button in the options dialog\n    Then the export dialog should close\n    And no export should be performed\n\n  Scenario: Export confirmation shows different message for sanitized export\n    When I tap on the export option\n    And I check the \"Sanitize Export\" option\n    And I tap the export button\n    Then the confirmation dialog should mention that personal information will be removed\n\n  Scenario: Export confirmation shows standard message for normal export\n    When I tap on the export option\n    And I leave the sanitize option unchecked\n    And I tap the export button\n    Then the confirmation dialog should show the standard export message